dimensionality_reduction_pca.when_pca_would_be_justified:
Dimensionality reduction like PCA would be justified if:
a) Working with high-dimensional spectrometry data (e.g., hundreds or thousands of infrared or NMR spectral bands where p > n);
b) Severe multicollinearity causing numerical instability in unregularized linear models;
c) Severe storage or low-latency computational constraints requiring compressed feature vectors.
